`benchmark.meta description: Builds buttons, each with leading and trailing slot outlets that apply style rules.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: timing

/core/markup
/gui

. count Size = 5000
. checksum Size = 0
for index in 0 .. < count
    . button = Button("Apply $index")
    checksum += button.title.length
-- "bench-result gui/button-build checksum=$checksum"
